<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks fall to 169,267.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks fall to 169,267.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 20 totaled 169,267 bales, down from 175,412 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 840 bales issued, 6,985 cancellations, no decertification orders, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
